<title>UK: SBC sets warrants on Aussie dlr/DEM exchange rate.</title>
<headline>SBC sets warrants on Aussie dlr/DEM exchange rate.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Schweizerischer Bankverein (Deutschland) AG has issued 10 million American-style call and put warrants, in two equal tranches, on the Australian dollar /mark exhange rate, lead manager SBC Warburg said.</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS:</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 20.DEC.96-15.SEP.97   PAYDATE	19.DEC.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   FFURT, DUSS	     MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  1.2242 DEM</p>
<p>* * * * * *</p>
<p> TYPE  STRIKE    ISSUE     PREMIUM    GEARING</p>
<p> CALL  1.25 DEM  2.42 DEM  4.08 PCT   50.59 X</p>
<p> PUT   1.25 DEM  7.85 DEM  4.30 PCT   15.59 X</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
